    'Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ is the main Forever direction here as the base aloe drink that people most often include as the inside foundation, and they most often start with 3 liters for the month, meaning 0.5 dcl twice daily.' => 'Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ je tukaj glavna izbira med izdelki Forever, saj gre za osnovni napitek z alojo, ki ga ljudje najpogosteje vključijo kot temelj podpore od znotraj. Najpogosteje začnejo s 3 litri na mesec, kar pomeni 0,5 dl dvakrat na dan.',
