    'minuta' => 'minuta',
    'This pack combines the four day DX4 and nine day C9 into one programme. It is designed to follow the included food and activity plan, rather than mix supplements independently.' => 'Ta paket združuje štiridnevni DX4 in devetdnevni C9 v en program. Zasnovan je tako, da slediš priloženemu načrtu prehrane in dejavnosti, namesto da prehranska dopolnila kombiniraš po svoje.',
