    'The Australian offer includes body, hair and dental care. Rather than choosing only by the number of products, consider which ones you will actually use.' => 'Avstralska ponudba vključuje izdelke za nego telesa, las in zob. Namesto da izbiraš le glede na število izdelkov, razmisli, katere boš dejansko uporabljal.',
