    'Forever Aloe First Spray is simplest to use after cleansing or washing by lightly spraying the outer area and letting it dry naturally.' => 'Forever Aloe First Spray je najpreprosteje uporabiti po čiščenju ali umivanju: rahlo popršite zunanji predel in pustite, da se naravno posuši.',
