    'cloaking_opengraph' => 'cloaking_opengraph',
    'Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ is the main Forever direction here as the aloe drink for an everyday routine.' => 'Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ je tu glavni izdelek Forever kot napitek z alojo za vsakodnevno rutino.',
