    'Login team' => 'Prijavi se v ekipo',
    'Brew it as directed, allow it to cool and serve over ice. Start with the preparation instructions on the pack.' => 'Pripravi ga po navodilih, počakaj, da se ohladi, in ga postrezi z ledom. Upoštevaj navodila za pripravo na embalaži.',
    'If you want a one-month frame, this is most often positioned as 3 x Forever Aloe Berry Nectar® and 1 x Forever Garlic-Thyme.' => 'Če želiš okvir za en mesec, se to najpogosteje predstavi kot 3 x Forever Aloe Berry Nectar® in 1 x Forever Garlic-Thyme.',
