    'Uklonjen' => 'Odstranjen',
    '13 Day Fit connects DX4 and C9 in one sequence. Review both guides and the preparation required for the full period.' => '13 Day Fit povezuje DX4 in C9 v eno zaporedje. Preglej oba vodnika in priprave, potrebne za celotno obdobje.',
    'Njega kože' => 'Nega kože',
