    'UTM Term' => 'Izraz UTM',
    'When the problem is under the arms, the recommendation should stay local, gentle and practical: deodorant stick as the main direction, with Aloe First as soothing support. Do not drift into face creams, exfoliators, minerals or broad beauty routines.' => 'Ko je težava pod pazduho, naj priporočilo ostane lokalno, nežno in praktično: dezodorant v stiku kot glavna izbira, Aloe First pa kot pomirjujoča podpora. Ne prehajaj na kreme za obraz, pilinge, minerale ali široko zasnovane lepotne rutine.',
