    'Review the portfolio with the collaborator, keep only the focused or business-relevant pages active, and archive the dead ends.' => 'Skupaj s sodelavcem preglej portfelj, aktivne pusti le strani, na katere se osredotočata ali so poslovno pomembne, slepe ulice pa arhiviraj.',
