    'Your funnel exists, but it had no clicks in the last 30 days. Share your app and send traffic into the funnel block.' => 'Tvoj lijak obstaja, vendar v zadnjih 30 dneh ni imel klikov. Deli svojo aplikacijo in usmeri obiskovalce v razdelek z lijakom.',
