    'px' => 'px',
    'This chat is here for Forever product guidance, simple wellness directions, FCC articles and business-interest follow-up. If you want, write what goal or product you are asking about and I will help from there.' => 'Ta klepet je namenjen usmerjanju glede izdelkov Forever, preprostim usmeritvam za dobro počutje, člankom FCC in nadaljnjemu pogovoru o zanimanju za sodelovanje. Če želiš, napiši, kateri cilj ali izdelek te zanima, in pomagal ti bom naprej.',
