    'For a real review, the best next step is to continue with the FCC partner or, if you are inside FCC, use the internal Coach for platform guidance.' => 'Za pravo oceno je najbolje, da nadaljujete s partnerjem FCC ali, če ste član FCC, uporabite internega Coach za usmeritve glede platforme.',
