    'Forever Aloe Berry Nectar® is the main Forever direction here as the berry aloe drink that is often chosen as the base nutritional routine.' => 'Forever Aloe Berry Nectar® je tukaj glavna izbira med izdelki Forever, saj gre za napitek z alojo in jagodičevjem, ki ga ljudje pogosto izberejo kot osnovo prehranske rutine.',
