    'A deodorant stick that fits into your morning routine or gym bag. Aloe Ever Shield combines aloe vera with odour protection, without aluminium salts.' => 'Dezodorant v stiku, ki ga zlahka vključiš v jutranjo rutino ali spraviš v torbo za trening. Aloe Ever Shield združuje aloe vero in zaščito pred neprijetnim vonjem, brez aluminijevih soli.',
