    'If you are asking specifically about Aloe Vera Gelly, the cleanest answer is to keep it on its real topical role for the skin.' => 'Če sprašuješ posebej o Aloe Vera Gelly, je najbolje ostati pri njegovi dejanski vlogi izdelka za nanos na kožo.',
