    'Awakening Eye Cream is the main Forever direction here when you want a targeted routine for the eye area and a fresher-looking gaze.' => 'Awakening Eye Cream je tukaj glavna izbira izdelka Forever, če želiš ciljno nego predela okoli oči in bolj svež videz pogleda.',
