    'For ticks, the first step should be the regular antiparasite protection recommended by your veterinarian. Only after that does it make sense to talk about any gentle skin-support routine.' => 'Pri klopih naj bo prvi korak redna zaščita proti zajedavcem, ki jo priporoči veterinar. Šele nato je smiselno govoriti o nežni rutini za podporo koži.',
