    'I understand the question about MLM or a "pyramid". Here, collaboration is described as independent activity connected to recommending and selling products and developing customers and, by personal choice, a team. Earnings are not guaranteed and this is not a promise of easy income. Assessing the model requires checking the current official terms, compensation, possible costs, returns and rules, which the owner of this app can explain. Speaking with the owner and leaving contact details are entirely voluntary.' => 'Razumem vprašanje o MLM oziroma »piramidi«. Tukaj je sodelovanje opisano kot samostojna dejavnost, povezana s priporočanjem in prodajo izdelkov ter pridobivanjem strank in, če se tako odločiš, razvijanjem ekipe. Zaslužek ni zagotovljen in to ni obljuba lahkega zaslužka. Za presojo modela je treba preveriti veljavne uradne pogoje, način plačila, morebitne stroške, vračila in pravila, ki ti jih lahko pojasni lastnik te aplikacije. Pogovor z lastnikom in posredovanje kontaktnih podatkov sta povsem prostovoljna.',
