    'An available alternative market is shown.' => 'Prikazana je ponudba za drugo razpoložljivo državo.',
    'Forever Marine Collagen is the clearest Forever direction here because it is built around marine collagen, vitamin C and biotin for a broader skin, hair and nail routine.' => 'Forever Marine Collagen je tukaj najbolj jasna usmeritev med izdelki Forever, saj temelji na morskem kolagenu, vitaminu C in biotinu za širšo rutino nege kože, las in nohtov.',
