    '🇹🇬 Togo' => '🇹🇬 Togo',
    'Illuminating Gel is part of the Sonya facial care routine. Explore its place in the steps and texture before comparing with other serums or gels.' => 'Illuminating Gel je del rutine nege obraza Sonya. Preden ga primerjaš z drugimi serumi ali geli, spoznaj njegovo mesto med koraki nege in njegovo teksturo.',
    'M3 10 12 3l9 7v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-7H9v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z' => 'M3 10 12 3l9 7v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-7H9v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z',
