    '· poruke' => 'Sporočila',
    'After saving, scan the QR on at least one phone before using it publicly. This is especially important when frames, gradients, logos, or printed materials are involved.' => 'Ko kodo QR shraniš, jo pred javno uporabo skeniraj z vsaj enim telefonom. To je še posebej pomembno, če uporabljaš okvirje, barvne prelive, logotipe ali tiskovine.',
