    '&#34;Forever Card Club - Your digital tool for increasing sales and recruitment. Utilize our application and NFC card to enhance your business.&#34;' => '&#34;Forever Card Club, tvoje digitalno orodje za povečanje prodaje in pridobivanje novih sodelavcev. Z našo aplikacijo in kartico NFC izboljšaj svoje poslovanje.&#34;',
    'If you want a one-month frame, this is most often positioned as 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ and 1 box of Forever Arctic Sea.' => 'Če želite okviren načrt za en mesec, se tukaj najpogosteje predvidijo 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ in 1 škatla Forever Arctic Sea.',
