    'In Brevo, use the exact URL shown above and Authentication method = No authentication. Do not add an extra custom authentication header on new setups. In the Actions step enable sent, delivered, deferred, opened, click, softBounce, hardBounce, blocked, invalid, spam, and unsubscribed.' => 'V storitvi Brevo uporabi točno zgoraj prikazani URL in za način preverjanja pristnosti izberi »Brez preverjanja pristnosti«. Pri novih nastavitvah ne dodajaj dodatne glave za preverjanje pristnosti po meri. V koraku Actions omogoči sent, delivered, deferred, opened, click, softBounce, hardBounce, blocked, invalid, spam in unsubscribed.',
    'Your users will get the email with the purpose of it being a mandatory notification email and not for marketing (such as privacy policy changes, security updates, etc).' => 'Uporabniki bodo prejeli e-poštno sporočilo kot obvezno obvestilo, ne kot trženjsko sporočilo, na primer o spremembah pravilnika o zasebnosti ali varnostnih posodobitvah.',
    'Is Aloe First an aloe drink?' => 'Ali je Aloe First napitek iz aloe vere?',
    'Uvježbaj: provjeri jasnoću objašnjenja' => 'Vadi: preveri, ali je razlaga jasna',
