    'Important: do not copy only the raw browser URL, because then your recommendation is not attached and the system cannot recognize it as your recommendation.' => 'Pomembno: ne kopiraj zgolj naslova URL iz brskalnika, saj v tem primeru tvoje priporočilo ni povezano z njim in ga sistem ne more prepoznati kot tvojega priporočila.',
