    'Forever Arctic Sea can be a good additional layer when you also want an omega-3 direction inside the same daily rhythm.' => 'Forever Arctic Sea je lahko dobra dodatna možnost, kadar želiš v isti dnevni ritem vključiti tudi omega-3.',
