    'Smart referral links are global links inside the Forever Card Club system that detect the visitor country, route them toward the official Forever webshop, and preserve the partner referral.' => 'Pametne priporočilne povezave so globalne povezave v sistemu Forever Card Club, ki zaznajo državo obiskovalca, ga usmerijo v uradno spletno trgovino Forever in ohranijo priporočilo partnerja.',
