    'Each product has its own directions. Check the quantity, ingredients and warnings on the pack you order. A combined pack does not mean using a whole bottle at once or increasing the daily dose.' => 'Vsak izdelek ima svoja navodila za uporabo. Preveri količino, sestavine in opozorila na pakiranju, ki ga naročaš. Kombinirano pakiranje ne pomeni, da moraš naenkrat porabiti celo stekleničko ali povečati dnevni odmerek.',
