    'Your growth plan and FCC Results use the same qualification signal for the 15+ and 50+ thresholds. WhatsApp and AI chat contacts provide additional context about interest but do not add points to these thresholds.' => 'Tvoj načrt rasti in rezultati FCC uporabljajo isti signal za izpolnjevanje pogojev pri pragovih 15+ in 50+. Stiki prek WhatsAppa in klepeta z AI dajejo dodaten vpogled v zanimanje, vendar ne prispevajo točk k tema pragovoma.',
    'Chat asistent' => 'Pogovorni pomočnik',
