    'When you share this article through this form, your referral link is added automatically. If someone orders products or visits Forever Card Club through that link, your contact details will be shown and the Forever Living Products Web Shop system will automatically record your recommendation.' => 'Ko ta članek deliš prek tega obrazca, se tvoja napotitvena povezava doda samodejno. Če kdo prek te povezave naroči izdelke ali obišče Forever Card Club, bodo prikazani tvoji kontaktni podatki, sistem spletne trgovine Forever Living Products pa bo samodejno zabeležil tvoje priporočilo.',
