    'For ingrown hairs after depilation, the recommendation should stay strictly inside a topical aftercare routine without drifting into unrelated supplements.' => 'Pri vraščenih dlakah po depilaciji naj priporočilo ostane strogo omejeno na rutino nege kože po depilaciji, brez prehajanja na nepovezana prehranska dopolnila.',
