    'Primary' => 'Primarna',
    'Forever Aloe First Spray makes sense as the support option when you want a light first outer step before the gelly layer.' => 'Forever Aloe First Spray je smiseln kot dodatna možnost, kadar želiš pred nanosom gela najprej uporabiti lahek izdelek za zunanjo uporabo.',
