    'Nova kartica' => 'Nova kartica',
    'Vendor' => 'Prodajalec',
    'If you want a one-month frame, this is most often positioned as 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™, 1 x Forever ImmuBlend, 1 x Forever B12 Plus and 1 x Forever Active Pro B.' => 'Če želiš okviren načrt za en mesec, se tu najpogosteje predlaga 3 x Forever Aloe Vera Gel™, 1 x Forever ImmuBlend, 1 x Forever B12 Plus in 1 x Forever Active Pro B.',
    'Bug' => 'Napaka',
