    'Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ makes sense as the support option on top as the simple inside aloe base for hydration and the everyday nutritional routine.' => 'Forever Aloe Vera Gel™ je smiselna dodatna možnost kot preprosta osnova z alojo za hidracijo in vsakodnevno prehransko rutino.',
    'Logic Gel Balancing Essence' => 'Logic Gel Balancing Essence',
