    'Forever Freedom® is the main Forever direction here because when bones, cartilage, arthritis and mobility are part of the same story, the routine should stay centered on the joint formula rather than an aloe drink.' => 'Forever Freedom® je tukaj glavna izbira med izdelki Forever, saj naj pri težavah, ki vključujejo kosti, hrustanec, artritis in gibljivost, rutina ostane osredotočena na formulo za sklepe, ne na napitek z alojo.',
