    'Clicks are lower by %s%% vs previous 30 days. This week publish at least 3 short posts and repeat the same link in each post.' => 'Klikov je za %s%% manj kot v prejšnjih 30 dneh. Ta teden objavi vsaj 3 kratke objave in v vsaki ponovi isto povezavo.',
